{
	"name": "Fainting Repose",
	"type": "feature",
	"img": "icons/skills/wounds/injury-pain-body-orange.webp",
	"system": {
		"description": "<p>When you would fail a Constitution saving throw versus a maneuver, spell, or spell-like effect, you may instead expend your reaction to faint and fall out of the way. You fall [[/condition id=prone]] as a result, but any effects you would experience are experienced as if you had succeeded the saving throw instead. Once you have used this ability, you may not do so again until you complete a long rest.</p>",
